Omege System
=============

Welcome to Omege System! This is target to i386 arch of simple operating system.

Quick Links
============
* Website: https://www.omegeuos.top/
* License: https://github.com/deeplearning-corporation/OmegeSystem/blob/main/LICENSE/
* Download: https://github.com/deeplearning-corporation/OmegeSystem/releases/

Credits List
============
