Thanks that peoples bring us Omege System!

Compile
========
If you needs compile Omege System operating system you needs install:
NASM Assembler
MinGW32-Make
Windows OS (Windows 10 and above)

run command:
mingw32-make all

Then it can be compiled.

Run
===
You can Download We'are operating system of image(OmegeSystem.img) file then can at Virtual machine Platform run.

